{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"アナウンス","text":"『────運転を見合わせております\r\n現在、運転再開の目途は立っておらず────』","trans":"“────目前暂停运行\n现在，重新开车的时间尚无法预计────”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020010","name":"摩美々","text":"電車、止まってるー……","trans":"电车，停运了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020020","name":"摩美々","text":"どうするー？","trans":"怎么办——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020030","name":"霧子","text":"歩いて……\r\n移動する……？","trans":"走路……\n过去……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020040","name":"摩美々","text":"隣の駅まで歩けば\r\n迂回はできるケドー……","trans":"走到隔壁车站的话\n是可以绕过去的啦——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020060","name":"霧子","text":"また……暑く……\r\nなっちゃうね……","trans":"又要……热起来……\n了呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020070","name":"摩美々","text":"電車動くまで、時間つぶすー？","trans":"在电车恢复前，消磨一下时间——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020090","name":"摩美々","text":"どこかお店入ろっかぁ","trans":"找家店进去坐坐吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020100","name":"霧子","text":"カフェ……\r\nどうかな……？","trans":"咖啡店……\n怎么样……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020110","name":"摩美々","text":"決まりー","trans":"就这么定了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020130","name":"摩美々","text":"冷房効きすぎなんですケドー……","trans":"空调开得太冷了吧——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020140","name":"霧子","text":"ひえひえ……だね……","trans":"冷冰冰的……呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020150","name":"霧子","text":"ブランケット……あるよ……","trans":"毯子……有哦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020160","name":"霧子","text":"はい……これ……","trans":"给……这个……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020180","name":"摩美々","text":"注文、どうするー？","trans":"点单，怎么办——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020190","name":"霧子","text":"あったかいの……いいな……","trans":"热的东西……不错呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020200","name":"摩美々","text":"確かにー","trans":"确实——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020210","name":"摩美々","text":"……あ、注文タッチパネルだねー","trans":"……啊，点单是触屏面板呢——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020220","name":"摩美々","text":"空調もこれで設定できたらいいのにー","trans":"要是空调也能用这个设定就好了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020240","name":"摩美々","text":"……あ、これにしよー","trans":"……啊，就点这个吧——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020250","name":"摩美々","text":"霧子はどうするー？","trans":"雾子要什么——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020260","name":"霧子","text":"わたしも……\r\n同じのに……","trans":"我也……\n一样就好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020270","name":"摩美々","text":"んー\r\n注文するねー","trans":"嗯——\n我来点吧——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020290","name":"摩美々","text":"……注文完了ー","trans":"……点完了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020300","name":"摩美々","text":"じゃー、まったりしますかぁ","trans":"那——就慢慢放松一下吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020320","name":"霧子","text":"ジェラート……おいしかったね……","trans":"冰淇淋……很好吃呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020330","name":"摩美々","text":"そうだねー","trans":"是啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020340","name":"摩美々","text":"ミルクもよかったケド\r\n霧子が食べてた────","trans":"牛奶味也不错啦\n雾子吃的那个————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020350","name":"摩美々","text":"……あの、なんだっけー","trans":"……那个，叫什么来着——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020360","name":"霧子","text":"えと……クランチ……\r\nクッキー……ジャン……","trans":"呃……脆片……\n饼干……酱……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020380","name":"摩美々","text":"……あ、クランチクッキージャンドゥーヤ","trans":"……啊，脆片饼干吉安杜雅","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020410","name":"摩美々","text":"これ、オンライン販売","trans":"这个，网上有卖","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020420","name":"摩美々","text":"お土産にできるじゃーん","trans":"可以当伴手礼嘛——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020430","name":"霧子","text":"みんなに……食べてもらえるね……","trans":"能让大家……都尝尝呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020440","name":"摩美々","text":"自分が家で食べる用じゃなくてー？","trans":"不是买给自己在家吃的吗——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020450","name":"霧子","text":"それも……\r\nいいね……","trans":"那个也……\n不错呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020460","name":"摩美々","text":"でも、今ここに持ってきてほしいかもー","trans":"不过，我倒是希望现在就送到这里来——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020470","name":"霧子","text":"あったかい……飲み物……\r\nひんやり……ジェラート……","trans":"热的……饮料……\n冰凉的……冰淇淋……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020480","name":"霧子","text":"ぴったり……","trans":"刚刚好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020490","name":"摩美々","text":"……あ、運転再開だって","trans":"……啊，说电车恢复运行了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020510","name":"摩美々","text":"今なら、外も涼しそー","trans":"现在的话，外面好像也凉快了——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020520","name":"霧子","text":"ちょうど……\r\nよさそうだね……","trans":"正好……\n好像不错呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020530","name":"摩美々","text":"そろそろ行くー？","trans":"差不多该走了——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020550","name":"霧子","text":"えっと……\r\nひんやり……？","trans":"那个……\n凉凉的……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3005025020560","name":"摩美々","text":"……や、夏ー","trans":"……不，是夏天——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}